<title>USA: Forest City Enterprises Q3 share rises.</title>
<headline>Forest City Enterprises Q3 share rises.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-12-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p> Shr profit	 $1.15	    profit  $0.0</p>
<p> Net profit	10,047	    profit   601</p>
<p> Sales&amp;Oper Revs 157,977		  120,989</p>
<p> Avg shrs	  8,742		    8,992</p>
<p>				 9 MONTHS</p>
<p> Shr profit	 $1.46	     loss   $0.18</p>
<p> Net  profit     12,830	     loss   1,664</p>
<p> Sales&amp;Oper Revs 424,026		   347,369</p>
<p> Avg shrs	   8,780			8,992</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: Q3 1996 results included a $9.6 million gain on disposition of properties and nine-month 1996 results include a $10.1 million gain.</p>
<p>1996 both periods include a provision for decline in real estate of $4.7 milion.</p>
<p>-- New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610</p>
